{"seq":2,"slug":"bayesian","title":"贝叶斯：证据如何改变信心","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/formal-epistemology/bayesian","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"conditionalization","title":"条件化与更新：证据到手后怎么改信念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/formal-epistemology/bayesian/conditionalization","wordCount":1677,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"confirmation-theory","title":"确证理论：证据支持假说有多强","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/formal-epistemology/bayesian/confirmation-theory","wordCount":1563,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"problem-of-priors","title":"先验问题：最初的信心从哪里来","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/formal-epistemology/bayesian/problem-of-priors","wordCount":1855,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"贝叶斯-证据如何改变信心\">贝叶斯：证据如何改变信心</h1><p>基础章确立了「理性信念度是概率」这个静态约束——在某一时刻，你的各个信念度必须彼此一致。但认识论的核心是动态的：证据来了，信心该怎么变？这一章就是贝叶斯纲领的主体，三篇分别处理更新的机制、评价证据支持力的尺度，以及整套框架最脆弱的入口。</p>\n<p>第一篇讲条件化：贝叶斯定理只是概率论的一条恒等式，真正有认识论分量的是「把新证据 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 到手后的新信念设为旧的条件概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo>∣</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\cdot\\mid E)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>」这条更新规则，以及当证据本身不确定时的杰弗里条件化；这里也会用「历时荷兰赌」说明为什么必须按这条规则更新。第二篇讲确证理论：「证据支持假说」不是全有全无，而是有量的——确证度量、贝叶斯因子刻画了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 的可信度抬高了多少，并借乌鸦悖论展示形式化如何澄清直觉冲突。第三篇直面先验问题：条件化告诉你如何从旧信念走到新信念，却对「最初的信念从哪来」保持沉默；无差别原则、最大熵、主观与客观贝叶斯之争、以及证据充分时先验会不会被「洗掉」的收敛定理，都是这一篇的战场。</p>\n<p>本章预设读者已接受基础章的结论，并会反复引用其中的概率公理与荷兰赌思路。它不处理无法塞进概率更新的信念变化（如接收到与原信念矛盾的新信息后如何收缩信念体系）——那是下一章 AGM 理论的领域。读完本章，你会掌握形式认识论中最成熟、应用最广的一套工具，也会看清它把「难题」推到了哪里。</p>\n"}